{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250522-the-mystery-of-the-forlorn-infinite-chakram","id":1250522,"title":"The Mystery of the forlorn Infinite Chakram","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-01T13:18:42-07:00","id":1250522,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> The Mystery of the forlorn Infinite Chakram","content":"- or -<br /> <br /> Why would I take a Light Artifact Thrown weapon? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> My group and I are doing a little Exalted tonight, at a con gaming session. The question came up: why would I take Light Artifact Thrown weapon?<ul><li>Artifact cost is based on Evocations.</li> <li>Medium Artifact Thrown weapons are numerically identical or superior in every stat: Damage and Overwhelming are better, while Attunement is the same and accuracy is determined by range anyway.</li> <li>Various light mortal thrown weapons have advantageous tags, such as concealability or poison delivery. Infinite Chakram seems to not be susceptible to having to be retrieved on a botched attack, but loses out on range compared to a Skycutter, and loses the Mounted tag of the mortal chakram.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> Is there something that would draw me to an Infinite Chakram instead of a Skycutter? Should it perhaps retain the Mounted tag as an errata? <br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T13:46:59-07:00","id":1250527,"title":"","content":"It's a form weapon for Air Dragon Style, and Skycutters aren't.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T14:35:41-07:00","id":1250534,"title":"","content":"The skycutter is physically larger. If you're trying to keep a lower profile and don't have the likes of Summoning the Loyal Steel, this <i>could</i> be something of a disadvantage.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T14:42:53-07:00","id":1250535,"title":"","content":"Good answers, thanks!<br /> <br /> Would you rule that the Infinite Chakram loses the Mounted tag, still?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T15:09:18-07:00","id":1250542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250522-the-mystery-of-the-forlorn-infinite-chakram?p=1250534#post1250534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The skycutter is physically larger. If you're trying to keep a lower profile and don't have the likes of Summoning the Loyal Steel, this <i>could</i> be something of a disadvantage.</div> </div> </div> </div>With Archery, there's a similar issue, Medium weapons are just better than Small weapons (the Large weapons all have the Slow tag), but a longbow is pretty difficult to hide, and is pretty awkward to carry around compared to a shortbow. <br /> (Flame pieces are also medium, and easy to conceal, but again have Slow tag.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T15:19:15-07:00","id":1250547,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure the infinite chakram not having the mounted tag has been confirmed as an error.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T15:54:07-07:00","id":1250557,"title":"","content":"Chakrams are cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T16:45:47-07:00","id":1250567,"title":"","content":"It's easier to justify an Infinite Chakram having &quot;bouncing off of everything like a demented pinball&quot; Evocations because of its shape than it is a Skycutter or any other thrown weapon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T16:46:23-07:00","id":1250568,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250522-the-mystery-of-the-forlorn-infinite-chakram?p=1250557#post1250557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Chakrams are cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>......And now I want to build an artifact Bowtie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T18:11:37-07:00","id":1250582,"title":"","content":"Skycutters can't be made into the brim of a tophat<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/jamesbond/images/9/91/Oddjob_%28Harold_Sakata%29_-_Profile.jpg/revision/latest/zoom-crop/width/720/height/720?cb=20130508000202\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T06:12:27-07:00","id":1251896,"title":"","content":"Good info... and an OddJob!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T06:48:09-07:00","id":1251903,"title":"","content":"While this admittedly isn't a reason for you, the player, picking the chakram over the boomerang, I'd wager the most common in-character reason for sticking with chakrams would simply be them being a popular weapon in your character's culture. Same way if you're from, say, Lookshy, you may instinctively prefer curved swords (Curved. Swords.) over straight ones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T17:36:45-07:00","id":1252059,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250522-the-mystery-of-the-forlorn-infinite-chakram?p=1250567#post1250567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's easier to justify an Infinite Chakram having &amp;quot;bouncing off of everything like a demented pinball&amp;quot; Evocations because of its shape than it is a Skycutter or any other thrown weapon.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250522-the-mystery-of-the-forlorn-infinite-chakram?p=1250582#post1250582\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Skycutters can't be made into the brim of a tophat</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s it, reasons found, /thread. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T19:07:29-07:00","id":1252079,"title":"","content":"Speaking of hats and chakrams: If your chakrams <i>aren't</i> infinite, <a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/Akali_Turban_with_quoits.JPG\" target=\"_blank\">you can still use a hat to carry them!</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T19:35:47-07:00","id":1252083,"title":"","content":"I'm going to just note here that Skycutters are cool too. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://inuyasha.wikia.com/wiki/Hiraikotsu\" target=\"_blank\">http://inuyasha.wikia.com/wiki/Hiraikotsu</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T20:36:02-07:00","id":1252106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1250522-the-mystery-of-the-forlorn-infinite-chakram?p=1252083#post1252083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--b